{"title": "Larian Studios", "pageid": 4389, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Larian_Studios", "categories": ["Game content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-game\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"title\">Larian Studios</h2><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Larian_logo.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Larian logo.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Larian_logo.png/300px-Larian_logo.png.webp\" srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Larian_logo.png/300px-Larian_logo.png.webp 1x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Larian_logo.png/600px-Larian_logo.png.webp 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Larian logo.png\" width=\"270\" height=\"314\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Details</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"founded\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Founded</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1996</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"founder\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Founder</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.imdb.com/name/nm3540642\">Swen Vincke</a></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"headquarters\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Headquarters</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ghent, Belgium</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"locations\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Locations</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"link\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Link</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://larian.com/\">https://larian.com/</a></div>\n</div></section></section></aside>\n\n<p><b>Larian Studios</b> is a Belgian video game developer and publisher founded in 1996 by Swen Vincke. The company is currently developing <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. Previous to Baldur's Gate, its most known games were the <i>Divinity</i> series, particularly <i>Divinity: Original Sin</i> and <i>Divinity: Original Sin II</i>, which earned over 300 awards in total. Larian has been using the <a href=\"/wiki/Early_Access\" title=\"Early Access\">Early Access</a> funding and development model since the former.\n</p><p>As of 2023, Larian Studios has studios in Gent, Quebec, Dublin, Kuala Lumpur, Guildford, and Barcelona. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Games_developed\">Games developed</span></h2>\n<ul><li>LED Wars (1998)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Divine_Divinity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Divine Divinity\" src=\"/w/images/4/4e/Wikipedia_w.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Divine_Divinity\">Divine Divinity</a></span> (2002)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beyond_Divinity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Beyond Divinity\" src=\"/w/images/4/4e/Wikipedia_w.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beyond_Divinity\">Beyond Divinity</a></span> (2004)</li>\n<li>Ketnet Kick (2004)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adventure_Rock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Adventure Rock\" src=\"/w/images/4/4e/Wikipedia_w.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adventure_Rock\">Adventure Rock</a></span> (2008)</li>\n<li>Ketnet Kick 2 (2008)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Divinity_II:_Ego_Draconis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Divinity II: Ego Draconis\" src=\"/w/images/4/4e/Wikipedia_w.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Divinity_II:_Ego_Draconis\">Divinity II: Ego Draconis</a></span> (2009)</li>\n<li>GulliLand (2009)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Superia_(video_game)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"Superia\" src=\"/w/images/4/4